Northlight OS — licence
=======================

Northlight OS is made of two kinds of work, and each keeps its own terms.

1. cleanyourtv (the launcher and tools this project is built on)
   Copyright (c) 2026 Gathin. MIT License, full text in part A below.

2. Everything the Northlight OS author added or changed (all of Northlight OS's own work)
   Copyright (c) 2026 the Northlight OS author. All rights reserved, under the terms in part B below.

Third-party assets keep their own licences: launcher/FONT-LICENSE-OFL.txt (Outfit font, SIL OFL),
launcher/ICONS-LICENSE-FLUENT-EMOJI.txt, and the ic_q_* icons (Material Design icons, Apache 2.0).

